WEBVTT

00:36.374 --> 00:37.749
Five years ago...

00:38.624 --> 00:39.666
The Drowning Ghost...

00:40.041 --> 00:41.791
made its first kill.

00:44.374 --> 00:48.206
Rumors then spread
of "a hungry beast"...

00:48.831 --> 00:50.249
"a watery wraith"...

00:50.791 --> 00:51.831
or a...

00:53.081 --> 00:55.380
"spirit that feasts on heads."

00:59.166 --> 01:02.666
But... all the details remain vague.

01:07.207 --> 01:08.874
Yet one thing is agreed upon...

01:09.791 --> 01:12.582
That this evil... is growing more vicious.

02:04.999 --> 02:07.499
To date, eight have been killed.

02:08.207 --> 02:10.457
And all... were headless.

02:11.541 --> 02:12.624
Their remains...

02:12.666 --> 02:14.999
are charmed and buried afar.

02:23.832 --> 02:25.041
Detective Kien...

02:25.457 --> 02:28.124
I write to ask you
to take on my case.

02:29.749 --> 02:34.999
My District was terrified...
when my niece, named Nga,

02:36.082 --> 02:37.791
suddenly vanished.

02:43.166 --> 02:44.374
This slipper is Nga's...

02:46.053 --> 02:48.303
So I was right!
Yet you doubt me!

02:48.805 --> 02:53.263
None would dare find Nga.
They think the Ghost has taken her.

02:53.832 --> 02:56.916
But until now,
her body has yet to surface.

02:59.166 --> 03:01.416
I pray she can still be found.

03:01.916 --> 03:05.249
Her life is on the line.

03:05.707 --> 03:07.541
I'm calling for your aid.

03:42.916 --> 03:47.781
DETECTIVE KIEN: THE HEADLESS HORROR

04:07.734 --> 04:08.524
No, sir!

04:09.291 --> 04:10.624
Don't touch her...

04:40.582 --> 04:45.793
[Calligraphy &amp; Painting Shop]

04:45.916 --> 04:49.820
[Treasure Shop]

04:49.916 --> 04:52.642
[In search of a missing relative
See Miss Moon]

04:52.702 --> 04:54.590
Moon's been searching for her niece.

04:54.707 --> 04:56.082
Closed her stall since!

04:56.957 --> 04:57.957
You want her?

04:58.035 --> 04:59.541
Try the District Chief's home.

04:59.909 --> 05:01.368
She should still be there.

05:03.298 --> 05:04.840
Yesterday he was "busy,"

05:05.166 --> 05:06.541
today he is "away."

05:07.354 --> 05:09.654
You know too well
those are excuses!

05:09.931 --> 05:12.223
If the District Chief
won't help, then who?

05:12.291 --> 05:13.400
That was his order.

05:13.457 --> 05:15.174
All your queries,
bring them tomorrow.

05:16.539 --> 05:18.206
Had it been your relative,

05:19.147 --> 05:20.897
could you wait until tomorrow?

05:22.026 --> 05:23.457
Don't be stubborn, ma'am.

05:30.966 --> 05:32.175
Chief Liem!

05:32.764 --> 05:34.348
I know you're in there!

05:34.815 --> 05:36.731
Nga has gone for five days!

05:37.046 --> 05:38.963
Why aren't you sending more men?!

05:39.243 --> 05:41.743
I alone can't search the whole District!

06:13.036 --> 06:13.993
Mister Kien?

06:16.365 --> 06:17.532
Greetings, Madam Moon.

06:20.786 --> 06:22.243
Just "Miss" is fine.

06:23.286 --> 06:24.868
"Madam" ages me so.

06:27.661 --> 06:28.618
Miss Moon.

06:33.243 --> 06:35.883
I wrote to you on a prayer.
But then, you're here.

06:42.911 --> 06:43.953
She's only a woman.

06:44.795 --> 06:45.801
No need for violence.

06:48.215 --> 06:49.609
The Chief is away today...

06:50.078 --> 06:51.036
Correct, you two?

06:52.493 --> 06:53.911
We'll return later, then.

06:58.002 --> 07:00.918
Right when my niece vanished,
I came to the Chief.

07:01.493 --> 07:04.453
But he kept saying... the culprit
was the Drowning Ghost.

07:05.020 --> 07:07.670
So he refused to
task his men to find Nga.

07:09.368 --> 07:11.411
Everyone thinks it's the Ghost...

07:12.145 --> 07:13.266
but not you, Miss?

07:14.036 --> 07:15.453
Since the dawn of time,

07:15.618 --> 07:18.525
those killed by the Ghost,
their bodies will surface!

07:18.582 --> 07:21.707
But as for Nga?
All I have is her slipper!

07:31.377 --> 07:33.419
Nga lives here with her father.

07:38.036 --> 07:40.619
I am Kien.
Detective of the Judge.

07:41.994 --> 07:42.869
Miss Moon?

07:43.994 --> 07:45.828
How did you know Mister Kien?

07:46.703 --> 07:47.953
My past husband...

07:48.953 --> 07:51.453
Kien arrested him for corruption.

07:52.286 --> 07:54.953
Well, now... You detained
Governor Duc Trong?

07:56.578 --> 07:57.578
Most admirable!

07:58.619 --> 07:59.661
You're too kind.

08:00.244 --> 08:01.619
I was doing my duty.

08:01.703 --> 08:04.744
I know only Mister Kien
can recover Nga.

08:05.078 --> 08:07.869
I wonder when... was the
last time you two saw Nga?

08:11.036 --> 08:12.244
About five days ago.

08:12.453 --> 08:15.953
That morning, she greeted me.
Then to market, she went.

08:16.078 --> 08:17.328
In recent days...

08:17.994 --> 08:19.786
did she behave strangely?

08:20.536 --> 08:21.411
No, good sir.

08:22.536 --> 08:23.994
Nga is of age to settle.

08:25.453 --> 08:27.119
Surely, she has a suitor?

08:29.161 --> 08:30.494
Why is that your query?

08:30.994 --> 08:32.286
I've had cases where...

08:32.703 --> 08:34.119
lovers flee together.

08:43.869 --> 08:45.328
Whatever else you need,

08:46.036 --> 08:47.161
seek out Moon here.

08:48.119 --> 08:49.369
I've matters to tend to.

08:51.828 --> 08:52.536
Pardon me.

09:02.703 --> 09:03.703
As you've said...

09:04.328 --> 09:05.911
Nga is a thing of beauty.

09:05.994 --> 09:07.328
She must have pursuers?

09:08.619 --> 09:10.119
Nga has none at all!

09:10.953 --> 09:11.994
How about enemies?

09:12.244 --> 09:13.744
She is as soft as a saint!

09:14.119 --> 09:15.828
In quarrels, she stays quiet.

09:16.494 --> 09:18.119
No way can she make enemies.

09:19.703 --> 09:20.703
Oh, wait.

09:22.619 --> 09:23.786
Two weeks ago...

09:24.619 --> 09:26.244
someone broke into her room!

09:28.494 --> 09:29.119
Broke into?

10:02.036 --> 10:03.661
Save me, all! A thief!

10:18.494 --> 10:20.258
Home's occupied, yet still intruded...

10:21.078 --> 10:22.874
Thieves here sure are bold.

10:28.994 --> 10:30.994
Besides jewel boxes and ceramics...

10:31.494 --> 10:32.786
is anything else lost?

10:33.286 --> 10:34.953
Only those things.

10:36.994 --> 10:39.328
Room's furnishings reveal
Nga as modest.

10:39.578 --> 10:40.994
So why would she spend...

10:41.119 --> 10:42.411
on these knick-knacks?

10:42.911 --> 10:44.369
I also think they're absurd.

10:46.578 --> 10:47.786
But I didn't mind...

10:49.328 --> 10:50.911
As long as she's happy.

10:55.911 --> 10:58.203
No signs of plundering
in her wardrobe.

10:59.036 --> 11:00.411
I don't think Nga ran away.

11:03.619 --> 11:05.286
May I see Nga's slipper?

11:05.494 --> 11:06.744
It's still at the lake.

11:07.369 --> 11:07.828
Hm?

11:08.203 --> 11:10.119
I'll guide you there.
It'll make sense.

11:11.453 --> 11:12.744
I thank you...

11:12.828 --> 11:13.994
but I'll go alone.

11:14.761 --> 11:15.511
Meaning?

11:15.536 --> 11:17.119
"Unless bound, love unfound."

11:17.494 --> 11:19.786
We walking together...
might fuel rumors.

11:32.203 --> 11:34.036
I was about to cast my line...

11:34.203 --> 11:36.161
and I saw the slipper
on the water!

11:46.764 --> 11:47.847
No amulet on you, sir?

11:49.208 --> 11:50.124
Amulet?

11:50.615 --> 11:51.782
Stay here, then.

12:13.703 --> 12:14.953
Xanthium fruit.

12:18.516 --> 12:20.070
The Drowning Ghost's victims...

12:20.639 --> 12:22.140
were found by this lake, sir?

12:24.012 --> 12:24.845
Yes...

12:26.380 --> 12:29.130
Folks believe...
where there is water...

12:29.255 --> 12:32.588
there the Ghost be.
In rivers, in lakes.

12:32.778 --> 12:34.153
None would go near.

12:36.046 --> 12:37.421
Pardon my rudeness...

12:38.186 --> 12:39.232
Leave it to me?

12:39.671 --> 12:41.389
I'd call a proper shaman!

12:42.046 --> 12:44.758
Another detective
won't solve anything!

12:46.588 --> 12:47.338
"Another"?

12:47.921 --> 12:50.722
District Chief Liem
already hired a detective.

12:51.088 --> 12:53.255
And after two days, he left!

12:54.764 --> 12:55.783
I heard that...

12:56.213 --> 12:57.755
the Ghost had haunted him!

15:41.380 --> 15:43.213
Mother's here.
Calm down! Calm!

15:44.171 --> 15:45.963
Calm down. I'm here!

15:47.421 --> 15:48.088
Drowning...

15:48.546 --> 15:49.171
What now?

15:49.921 --> 15:51.171
The Ghost was taking me!

15:51.296 --> 15:53.171
It was about to, mother!

15:53.796 --> 15:55.088
Move her outside now.

15:56.630 --> 15:58.046
Don't let ghosts roam here!

15:58.088 --> 15:58.978
All right, love!

15:59.500 --> 16:00.437
I'll handle it...

16:07.630 --> 16:08.963
Don't just stand there!

16:09.463 --> 16:11.546
Fetch new clothes
for Miss Tuyet, quick!

16:11.588 --> 16:12.088
Yes...

16:45.713 --> 16:47.296
I've asked it many times.

16:48.380 --> 16:48.921
"Kill".

16:50.588 --> 16:53.671
It wants only carnage,
and demands nothing else.

17:01.546 --> 17:03.088
This evil is most powerful.

17:03.630 --> 17:05.732
But my incense and amulet
can protect you.

17:06.880 --> 17:09.796
Matters of the Living and the Dead...
have none in common.

17:09.880 --> 17:12.088
There are things beyond perception.

17:12.463 --> 17:13.671
May you be safe.

17:13.755 --> 17:14.479
Thanks, Shaman.

17:15.285 --> 17:16.796
You'd be well-versed in herbs...

17:17.500 --> 17:20.171
I wonder where do...
xanthium fruits grow here?

17:25.543 --> 17:26.884
I'd find them by the falls.

17:50.087 --> 17:51.381
So many ghosts around!

17:52.181 --> 17:53.222
One underwater...

17:53.323 --> 17:54.244
One behind trees...

17:57.542 --> 17:58.927
I've told you before!

17:59.097 --> 18:01.094
Nga wasn't taken
by the Drowning Ghost!

18:01.181 --> 18:02.847
So why see Shaman Tinh, then?

18:03.470 --> 18:04.387
Do you trust me?

18:05.262 --> 18:07.387
Then let me find her
with my methods.

18:07.758 --> 18:09.524
So why bar me
from coming with you?

18:10.001 --> 18:11.583
I know your character well.

18:12.014 --> 18:13.222
Heart on both sleeves.

18:13.681 --> 18:14.722
Forward to a fault.

18:16.806 --> 18:19.514
That is me... when I was
a Governor's Madam.

18:19.556 --> 18:21.591
- Nowadays, I am...
- The very same!

18:26.097 --> 18:27.014
How about...

18:27.139 --> 18:28.556
I'll tuck my heart in.

18:28.888 --> 18:29.781
Better?

18:33.056 --> 18:33.936
Fine, then!

18:34.097 --> 18:36.306
You have your methods,
I have mine!

18:37.251 --> 18:38.001
Hold on.

18:40.514 --> 18:42.014
I'm going to Vu Thien Falls.

18:42.671 --> 18:43.705
You must know the way?

18:47.822 --> 18:49.030
Not only do I know,

18:49.285 --> 18:50.660
I also have a faster way.

19:51.681 --> 19:52.431
Blood!

19:52.806 --> 19:53.889
Could it be...

19:54.431 --> 19:56.347
- Heavens!
- Miss Moon...

19:57.556 --> 19:59.931
This might be someone else's.
Or an animal's.

20:00.014 --> 20:01.514
Don't jump to conclusions.

20:04.389 --> 20:06.696
If Nga is hurt, we must find her!

20:07.540 --> 20:08.415
Stay calm.

20:08.639 --> 20:11.304
At any cost, I'll return Nga to you.

20:11.634 --> 20:14.009
But now we must
be collected, be clear.

20:14.102 --> 20:15.019
You hear me?

20:21.306 --> 20:22.639
To find a person...

20:23.597 --> 20:25.319
I must really know who they are.

20:26.458 --> 20:27.825
And I've told you everything.

20:30.768 --> 20:32.852
I haven't been told
about Nga's mother.

20:33.675 --> 20:35.240
Your elder sister,
she ran away, yes?

20:37.369 --> 20:38.410
How do you know?

20:39.347 --> 20:42.067
No spirit tablet on the altar.
That means she's alive.

20:42.133 --> 20:43.380
And when I said Nga ran away...

20:44.222 --> 20:45.639
Sir Vinh reacted oddly.

20:50.070 --> 20:51.790
When Nga was a few months old...

20:53.389 --> 20:55.014
her mother left with her lover.

21:00.514 --> 21:02.431
And folks sure had cruel tongues.

21:03.681 --> 21:05.749
Some said with certainty...

21:06.097 --> 21:08.347
Nga wasn't related to Sir Vinh.

21:09.639 --> 21:11.181
No one knew the facts.

21:11.556 --> 21:15.956
But the sight of Nga...
was her father's shame.

21:17.722 --> 21:20.306
My sister's actions,
I can't vouch for them.

21:20.889 --> 21:23.097
But I couldn't abandon her child.

21:24.556 --> 21:28.931
For the longest time,
we were thick as thieves.

21:30.889 --> 21:34.008
No child here would play with her.

21:34.472 --> 21:36.222
They talked among themselves...

21:36.306 --> 21:40.501
that since Nga is a bastard child,
both her parents left her.

21:55.447 --> 21:56.197
Nga?

21:57.306 --> 21:59.472
Do you know... what this is?

22:01.847 --> 22:05.580
It's a treasure.
It will always empowers you.

22:06.222 --> 22:08.056
Granny gave this bangle to me.

22:09.139 --> 22:10.181
And now...

22:10.514 --> 22:12.306
it shall be yours.

22:15.847 --> 22:17.925
Auntie, won't you be sad,
giving it to me?

22:18.597 --> 22:19.639
No way.

22:20.056 --> 22:23.014
I'll be happy, in fact.
Do you know why?

22:23.889 --> 22:25.306
Because you love me most.

22:25.389 --> 22:27.133
Do you know why I love you most?

22:31.347 --> 22:33.100
Because you are my mother.

22:46.306 --> 22:48.970
I'll make arrangements to visit Nga.

22:49.333 --> 22:50.583
In case I can't...

22:51.548 --> 22:52.881
...I'll write letters.

22:53.722 --> 22:55.389
Or send gifts to cheer her up.

22:55.472 --> 22:58.181
I'd rather you had cut Nga off
like a spare thread!

22:58.590 --> 22:59.514
Then it's done!

23:02.033 --> 23:04.097
She's your thread, not a thread!

23:07.972 --> 23:10.306
Keep your venom
in your mouth, please.

23:10.389 --> 23:12.681
Your sister, its mother,
even ran from it!

23:13.347 --> 23:15.972
Your father needed you
to be a wife, so go be one!

23:16.181 --> 23:18.847
Did anyone force you...
to be a moral preacher?!

23:20.097 --> 23:21.097
Stop being nosy!

23:52.597 --> 23:57.347
At the Market's gates,
whether rain or shine,

23:58.181 --> 23:59.431
she'd wait for me.

24:02.139 --> 24:06.889
Despite what folks said,
Nga wouldn't believe I had left.

24:12.347 --> 24:16.806
Years kept on passing,
and Nga kept on blooming.

24:17.347 --> 24:20.222
The thing was,
she was still looked at...

24:20.306 --> 24:22.472
with unkind eyes.

24:25.544 --> 24:27.419
Meal before your herbs, father.

24:27.472 --> 24:29.431
I've prepared them in the kitchen.

24:34.681 --> 24:37.056
I'll... go to our fabric stall now.

24:43.972 --> 24:45.514
When I left her...

24:46.681 --> 24:48.306
she was a baby.

24:50.472 --> 24:52.264
But when I lost it all...

24:53.097 --> 24:55.139
I searched for her.

24:58.352 --> 24:59.306
Nga?

25:51.514 --> 25:53.972
I don't deserve a child like Nga...

25:58.306 --> 26:00.431
I left her without a word.

26:02.121 --> 26:03.831
Yet she forgave me, still.

26:15.556 --> 26:16.722
This towel...

26:18.012 --> 26:20.887
Has it been washed?
I find it...

26:22.063 --> 26:22.962
muddy?

26:27.963 --> 26:29.047
Don't worry!

26:29.357 --> 26:30.520
I bought it new.

26:31.128 --> 26:33.587
True shade of schmaltz.
Not mud.

26:39.389 --> 26:41.972
It's as I thought...
Nga met trouble at the falls.

26:42.347 --> 26:43.972
She lost her slipper.

26:44.389 --> 26:46.794
It then followed the creek
and got to the lake.

26:47.097 --> 26:49.236
Should we return to the falls,
Mister Kien?

26:50.889 --> 26:51.900
Miss Moon...

26:51.972 --> 26:53.972
We've trailed the creek
the whole day.

26:54.097 --> 26:55.931
And there's no sign of Nga.

26:56.556 --> 26:58.704
Come morning, we find another lead.

27:01.056 --> 27:03.264
As you command, Judge's Detective....

27:05.056 --> 27:07.431
Hear ye, hear ye!

27:07.681 --> 27:10.139
The night has peaked

27:10.389 --> 27:12.847
Folks near and far

27:13.097 --> 27:15.556
Join locks, close doors

27:15.806 --> 27:18.097
Don't let the Ghost

27:18.264 --> 27:21.472
Break and enter!

28:10.097 --> 28:11.014
"Hiet"...

30:40.306 --> 30:43.764
You told Miss Moon... on that day
Nga left earlier than usual?

30:44.556 --> 30:45.889
Do you know the cause?

30:46.264 --> 30:49.014
No, sir! I only saw her going south.

30:51.931 --> 30:53.514
Closing up early, Nga?

31:03.847 --> 31:05.727
South is where the falls are.

31:07.847 --> 31:10.240
On that day...
was Nga acting strangely?

31:11.222 --> 31:12.389
I'm not so sure...

31:13.503 --> 31:14.608
But there was this...

31:15.097 --> 31:18.264
I was setting up my stall.
Saw Nga with a patron.

31:19.347 --> 31:22.347
But... they seemed to be quarreling.

31:35.251 --> 31:37.030
Do you recognize that patron?

31:37.389 --> 31:39.389
Miss Tuyet, the Chief's daughter.

31:53.097 --> 31:54.847
Greetings, great District Chief.

31:55.889 --> 31:58.493
I am Kien.
Detective of the Judge.

31:58.806 --> 32:01.806
I visited you prior,
but was told you were busy.

32:01.931 --> 32:03.347
You've traveled far.

32:04.056 --> 32:05.740
What is your matter here?

32:05.972 --> 32:08.437
I've come to investigate
Miss Nga's disappearance.

32:15.556 --> 32:17.472
Whatever you need, do let me know.

32:17.858 --> 32:19.207
I'll support you in full.

32:19.534 --> 32:21.613
I only ask for
an audience with Tuyet...

32:22.514 --> 32:23.793
the Young Lady of the house.

32:30.206 --> 32:32.081
A witness said you met Nga...

32:32.412 --> 32:33.662
on the day she vanished.

32:34.264 --> 32:36.806
There might have... been a quarrel?

32:36.897 --> 32:37.710
Yes.

32:38.306 --> 32:39.597
It was trivial.

32:40.306 --> 32:44.007
I ordered some brocade,
but Nga got the wrong color.

32:45.306 --> 32:46.498
How did you two resolve it?

32:46.931 --> 32:49.298
I'd only pay for the right color.

32:50.306 --> 32:51.575
But Nga refused?

32:57.347 --> 32:58.472
She was furious.

32:59.556 --> 33:02.556
Also said she'd get money
from Thac if I didn't pay up.

33:02.639 --> 33:03.264
Thac?

33:03.622 --> 33:04.955
He's my fiance.

33:05.472 --> 33:07.347
I know not where my son's gone to.

33:07.431 --> 33:10.222
This whole week, he's a rare sight.

33:10.472 --> 33:13.681
Some nights he'd return,
gather tools, and out again!

33:14.806 --> 33:16.847
Does Thac work with ceramics?

33:17.823 --> 33:21.156
Not "work."
"Fidget" is more like it.

33:21.222 --> 33:22.920
He has a pottery in the bamboo grove.

33:24.222 --> 33:25.681
In our home now...

33:25.847 --> 33:27.431
do we have Thac's works?

33:27.556 --> 33:28.808
Yes. I'll get you one.

33:34.764 --> 33:36.921
How did you link Thac with ceramics?

33:42.880 --> 33:43.922
The character "hiet"...

33:45.146 --> 33:45.980
Please explain?

33:49.030 --> 33:51.114
A character before "hiet" is missing.

33:53.502 --> 33:54.597
Think about it.

33:55.097 --> 33:56.889
What if it was "thach"?

33:59.001 --> 34:00.722
And when you write "thach" with "hiet"...

34:02.431 --> 34:03.431
We'll get "thac".

34:19.389 --> 34:22.806
This pottery village?
Before, it was lively.

34:23.181 --> 34:27.056
But later on, the ceramists
were touched by evil.

34:27.139 --> 34:29.722
They were terrified,
so they all left!

34:35.472 --> 34:36.222
Don't worry!

34:36.847 --> 34:38.514
Rat snake. Not venomous.

34:39.556 --> 34:41.472
But it has teeth, there!

34:41.847 --> 34:44.806
If it bites, I might faint!

34:51.972 --> 34:54.181
I must say, Thac's a brave one!

34:54.222 --> 34:57.431
- Picking a creepy place to work.
- Easy to see why.

34:58.222 --> 35:00.972
It's deserted...
Hidden from view...

35:01.431 --> 35:04.181
If I'm up to no good,
this place is rather ideal.

35:05.972 --> 35:07.056
"Up to no good"?

35:08.431 --> 35:10.306
A beauty such as Nga...

35:11.056 --> 35:13.347
will draw many towards her.

35:14.597 --> 35:15.722
And not all...

35:16.597 --> 35:18.139
host goodness in them.

35:19.681 --> 35:21.764
This whole week, Thac is rarely home.

35:22.889 --> 35:24.806
Around this time, Nga is also lost.

35:26.347 --> 35:28.097
Do you see the coincidence?

35:48.114 --> 35:49.197
Wait out here, Miss.

35:50.909 --> 35:52.325
Let me go in and check.

35:52.514 --> 35:54.254
Oh? No, no, no, no, no, no!

35:54.331 --> 35:57.420
Danger might be inside.
If there is, just let me handle it.

37:06.181 --> 37:07.101
Nga?

39:52.014 --> 39:54.142
Mister Kien! Kien!
This is Thac.

39:54.222 --> 39:55.431
You all right, Miss?

39:55.945 --> 39:57.950
I... Thac startled me, is all.

39:58.041 --> 39:59.170
Why are you intruding?

39:59.304 --> 40:01.970
We're searching for
Miss Moon's niece... Nga.

40:04.370 --> 40:05.286
And you are?

40:05.722 --> 40:07.139
Detective of the Judge.

40:08.193 --> 40:09.169
Whose body is it up there?!

40:13.764 --> 40:14.556
Speak!

40:20.355 --> 40:21.296
This "body," you ask?

40:30.434 --> 40:31.767
Why search for Nga here?

40:32.606 --> 40:34.827
Nowhere in this region
sells your ceramics.

40:35.234 --> 40:37.525
Yet they are found in Nga's room.

40:38.264 --> 40:39.597
There must be a reason?

40:41.470 --> 40:42.428
About that...

40:46.014 --> 40:47.484
- It's complicated.
- That's fine.

40:48.304 --> 40:50.001
I'm familiar with complications.

41:02.306 --> 41:05.056
Nga and I... We are outcasts.

41:06.650 --> 41:08.567
As us, finding company is tough...

41:09.628 --> 41:11.461
let alone a better half.

41:14.979 --> 41:16.604
When I first saw Nga...

41:17.602 --> 41:19.684
I kept thinking of her visage.

41:20.854 --> 41:21.979
How serene it is...

41:22.722 --> 41:24.264
But also desolate.

41:52.072 --> 41:53.014
Miss Fabric...

41:54.597 --> 41:55.494
Mister Thac.

42:15.849 --> 42:18.391
Pardon me...
for freely using your likeness.

42:21.931 --> 42:24.128
You're saying... that is me?

42:26.931 --> 42:28.173
Not much resemblance, yes?

42:29.314 --> 42:30.230
There's a lot!

42:33.128 --> 42:34.604
Except for the face.

42:39.554 --> 42:40.887
Won't you sit down, then?

42:41.097 --> 42:43.097
When you were here for the breeze...

42:44.681 --> 42:46.109
I could only see glimpses.

42:49.764 --> 42:50.593
Miss Nga!

42:52.472 --> 42:55.134
If I can't see you in detail,
then how can I have you?

43:06.722 --> 43:08.176
- Mister Thac?
- Hm?

43:09.514 --> 43:11.889
Has anyone told you,
you are of the Heavens?

43:17.050 --> 43:18.383
It would be fitting.

43:18.514 --> 43:20.347
You're the son of a wealthy house.

43:21.308 --> 43:23.225
Everything is within reach.

43:24.059 --> 43:26.018
Yet you find joy in messing with clay!

43:27.171 --> 43:28.791
It's more than "messing with clay."

43:33.889 --> 43:35.097
Before, this was soil.

43:36.097 --> 43:37.472
Now, it's a bowl.

43:38.629 --> 43:39.545
But to me?

43:40.056 --> 43:41.139
This is devotion.

43:42.597 --> 43:45.404
Too much devotion, though?
None will buy it!

43:49.047 --> 43:51.755
I believe someone will, ultimately.

44:25.922 --> 44:26.744
Nga...

44:29.764 --> 44:31.208
I've something to share with you.

44:36.889 --> 44:37.897
I'm engaged.

44:42.889 --> 44:44.139
When I was young,

44:45.681 --> 44:47.129
I'd been arranged to be with Tuyet.

44:48.389 --> 44:49.764
But because she...

44:51.455 --> 44:52.588
has a different element...

44:53.139 --> 44:55.181
She must wait
until now to be wed.

45:00.014 --> 45:01.014
I am sorry.

45:04.459 --> 45:05.903
When will you take her hand?

45:08.106 --> 45:09.274
At the year's end.

45:15.264 --> 45:17.597
People keep on leaving me...

45:20.597 --> 45:22.722
That has to be my fate.

45:23.514 --> 45:25.097
I was only a young boy.

45:27.005 --> 45:28.963
I didn't know of these arrangements.

45:32.014 --> 45:33.806
Before, I didn't even know...

45:33.858 --> 45:34.900
what is love.

45:35.639 --> 45:37.056
Until I met you.

45:42.764 --> 45:44.014
How could you know...

45:44.597 --> 45:45.847
if it was love?

45:47.014 --> 45:49.181
Because after I first met you,

45:52.657 --> 45:55.032
you had occupied all of my thoughts.

45:58.689 --> 45:59.898
Just as you now are.

46:02.787 --> 46:04.212
I only want to greet you daily.

46:06.643 --> 46:08.215
You are whom I wish to wed.

46:09.852 --> 46:10.977
You, and none other.

46:24.931 --> 46:26.764
I'm so touched I'm tipsy!

46:27.972 --> 46:29.931
Nga is only a target to you.

46:30.297 --> 46:31.904
Hence the secrecy and privacy!

46:32.969 --> 46:34.844
Aunt Moon, you haven't known me well.

46:35.536 --> 46:36.505
Don't judge yet.

46:37.764 --> 46:39.597
This pottery seems inactive.

46:41.489 --> 46:42.820
Why are you the only one here?

46:43.014 --> 46:44.827
This whole week, I've searched for Nga.

46:46.191 --> 46:47.837
I've closed up
so my staff can help.

46:48.195 --> 46:49.529
Your love is deep...

46:50.597 --> 46:51.972
yet it must stay hidden?

46:53.014 --> 46:54.556
We only treat each day we meet...

46:56.041 --> 46:57.791
as the only time we get to have.

46:59.722 --> 47:01.264
Can this Aunt chime in?

47:01.972 --> 47:05.066
All your sorrow artist act is just
a way to lure girls.

47:05.347 --> 47:07.742
You see Nga alone
so you strike, yes?!

47:08.139 --> 47:09.701
Miss Moon's heated since
she loves Nga.

47:10.264 --> 47:11.764
Forgive her word choices.

47:12.515 --> 47:15.347
Her tongue is sharp,
but her heart is soft.

47:15.429 --> 47:16.471
Correct, Miss Moon?

47:18.801 --> 47:19.664
True...

47:21.164 --> 47:23.206
my bond with Nga lacks clarity.

47:24.518 --> 47:26.518
But never do I think
it's temporary.

47:33.059 --> 47:34.143
Dearest Chief...

47:34.518 --> 47:37.434
our house will manage
all this dowry.

47:37.809 --> 47:40.766
A happy end to our marriage challenge.

47:49.352 --> 47:51.268
My Chief? His Lady?

47:51.809 --> 47:53.184
I have a request to make.

47:55.559 --> 47:58.309
I request to take Nga,
Sir Vinh's daughter,

47:58.727 --> 47:59.684
as my Second Madam.

48:02.977 --> 48:05.768
The Chief's house...
respects all rules and rites.

48:05.934 --> 48:09.602
We can't host a broken member like Nga.

48:10.102 --> 48:13.518
My Lady, her broken house
speaks not for her character.

48:14.507 --> 48:16.161
- Although Nga...
- If you want Tuyet?

48:17.266 --> 48:18.674
You can't have Nga
as your Second!

48:25.754 --> 48:27.039
You may shun me, father...

48:28.045 --> 48:29.787
but I must end this arrangement!

48:29.879 --> 48:31.920
How dare you refuse me?

48:32.675 --> 48:33.800
You have no right!

48:42.670 --> 48:44.545
You have arranged my marriage.

48:45.212 --> 48:46.379
Now whom I choose...

48:46.670 --> 48:49.170
or what I do...
I must seek your approval first?!

48:49.462 --> 48:50.712
I am not a puppet!

48:56.901 --> 49:00.234
As Thac said, your marriage
with him folded...

49:00.734 --> 49:02.710
- because of Nga.
- How so?

49:03.776 --> 49:05.443
An outrageous thought!

49:06.568 --> 49:07.715
Clear it up for them, mother!

49:08.151 --> 49:10.734
We forgave Thac for his insane request.

49:11.044 --> 49:13.794
He also agreed to leave Nga for Tuyet.

49:14.276 --> 49:17.109
And he turned on us, still?!

49:23.818 --> 49:25.748
I shall set it right with his family!

49:27.526 --> 49:28.609
From this point on...

49:28.859 --> 49:33.151
none from the Chief's house,
or the Ho Dac's, can interact.

49:36.318 --> 49:37.652
Please keep that in mind.

49:40.859 --> 49:42.359
Between you and Nga...

49:42.526 --> 49:44.859
There was more than a business dispute.

49:45.151 --> 49:48.193
Demanding for pay was just
Nga's excuse to fight me.

49:48.609 --> 49:51.776
She was adamant that Thac
marry her because...

49:54.359 --> 49:56.234
she's been carrying his baby.

49:57.459 --> 49:58.359
What now?

49:59.053 --> 50:00.219
Are you all mad?!

50:01.655 --> 50:03.376
How can Nga have my baby?

50:04.776 --> 50:07.068
We want to stay pure
until we're official.

50:07.695 --> 50:09.445
I want her to regain her status!

50:10.647 --> 50:12.564
If she can't be Thac's mistress...

50:13.747 --> 50:15.997
Nga will spread news of the baby.

50:19.080 --> 50:20.580
Such a schemer...

50:21.330 --> 50:22.122
Oh?!

50:22.516 --> 50:23.516
What scheme now?

50:24.663 --> 50:27.538
Don't use your snobby tongue
to accuse others!

50:27.622 --> 50:28.997
You watch your tongue!

50:29.205 --> 50:31.705
You're addressing members
of the Chief's house!

50:31.955 --> 50:33.729
Don't speak emptily.

50:35.788 --> 50:37.783
I used to live with a Governor.

50:38.122 --> 50:41.010
No stranger to your oppressive tone!

50:41.455 --> 50:42.288
Everyone...

50:43.247 --> 50:44.205
be calm now.

50:44.955 --> 50:48.054
Your beloved niece is a bastard child.

50:48.122 --> 50:49.788
No proper upbringing!

50:49.913 --> 50:51.955
No wonder she's disobedient!

50:52.997 --> 50:54.788
Can't reason so you're rude now, huh?!

50:56.288 --> 50:57.830
But that's fine!

50:58.997 --> 51:02.009
No Chief's home... has ever been civil!

51:02.455 --> 51:05.580
Your man has
no wealth, or status...

51:05.705 --> 51:07.455
and also a life in prison!

51:07.830 --> 51:10.727
All because he chose a poor wife!

51:10.788 --> 51:12.455
And to have chosen you...

51:12.788 --> 51:14.913
I pray Chief Liem won't crack soon!

51:14.975 --> 51:16.039
- You...
- Hush, hush, hush!

51:16.417 --> 51:17.792
Stop baring your claws.

51:18.288 --> 51:19.705
Or else take it outside!

51:22.549 --> 51:23.465
Heavens!

51:24.455 --> 51:25.830
Thac has a temper.

51:27.372 --> 51:29.413
If Nga uses the baby
to pressure him...

51:33.163 --> 51:34.330
Damn it!

51:35.163 --> 51:36.497
Those scumbags!

51:37.330 --> 51:39.766
Why must I be branded with such lies?!

51:46.562 --> 51:47.729
Mister Kien...

51:48.872 --> 51:51.610
Could Nga have... gone to the falls
to meet Thac?

51:54.455 --> 51:56.189
And if they had fought, then...

52:00.997 --> 52:03.629
I must say, Nga's case is a tough one.

52:12.997 --> 52:14.595
Many troubling knots.

52:15.372 --> 52:16.955
Many shady faces.

52:18.372 --> 52:19.997
The houses of Thac and the Chief...

52:20.538 --> 52:22.788
have their reasons to harm Nga.

52:25.913 --> 52:27.830
Assuming Nga's baby is real...

52:28.163 --> 52:29.997
and it's been made public.

52:30.475 --> 52:31.475
Whom, then...

52:31.689 --> 52:33.772
will see the most losses?

52:34.288 --> 52:36.010
Thac... and his house, Ho Dac.

52:36.122 --> 52:38.663
They will lose face,
and also standing.

52:42.705 --> 52:43.563
Mister Kien?

52:44.195 --> 52:46.736
Could they have just risked it
and killed Nga?

52:48.538 --> 52:49.705
That's a question for...

52:50.888 --> 52:52.305
he who intruded Nga's room.

52:53.663 --> 52:54.830
You're saying...

52:55.413 --> 52:56.372
the thief...

52:56.938 --> 52:58.605
wasn't just thieving?

52:58.730 --> 52:59.563
Yes.

52:59.813 --> 53:01.188
If Thac wanted to hide,

53:01.563 --> 53:03.188
or to deny his link with Nga,

53:04.730 --> 53:07.022
he would need to destroy
his ceramics.

53:10.355 --> 53:11.605
They are the only thing...

53:12.188 --> 53:13.384
binding their ties.

53:19.730 --> 53:22.962
And the thief... was hired by Thac
to ruin the goods.

53:29.105 --> 53:30.895
Nga stabbed the intruder's hand.

53:31.813 --> 53:33.313
It wouldn't have healed yet.

53:37.313 --> 53:38.123
Miss Moon?

53:40.438 --> 53:43.673
I have this idea... to search for
the one with a scarred hand.

53:44.043 --> 53:44.957
I'm in.

53:51.688 --> 53:54.813
Hear ye hear ye!

53:54.938 --> 53:57.514
To mark her stall's opening anniversary...

53:57.563 --> 54:01.188
the marvelous Miss Moon
shall host a competition...

54:01.313 --> 54:02.188
so named...

54:03.313 --> 54:04.313
knife-throwing!

54:04.688 --> 54:05.813
The one who wins...

54:05.855 --> 54:08.813
shall be given a precious jade bracelet!

54:09.022 --> 54:10.147
Greetings, all!

54:10.230 --> 54:13.079
Line up neatly and wait for your turn!

54:49.838 --> 54:50.718
Grandpa!

54:55.938 --> 54:57.897
Hey! Can't you see?!

54:58.166 --> 54:59.190
The target's here, man!

55:29.688 --> 55:32.397
Dong here used to work
in the Chief's home.

55:32.730 --> 55:35.813
Until he was accused of thievery.

55:36.147 --> 55:38.605
Details weren't clear.
All I knew was...

55:38.725 --> 55:42.313
Chief Liem ordered guards
to beat him out in the market.

56:15.188 --> 56:16.313
Let's find some cover.

56:16.979 --> 56:18.688
See how Dong behaves,

56:19.147 --> 56:20.173
and then we...

56:31.711 --> 56:32.959
Are you thieving from a thief?

56:33.188 --> 56:36.022
Ceramics, Mister Kien.
With Thac's name.

56:48.980 --> 56:50.105
You two...

56:58.063 --> 56:59.533
I'm the Judge's Detective.

57:17.897 --> 57:19.688
Dong! Stop now!

57:24.968 --> 57:26.009
Dong!

57:27.313 --> 57:28.188
Hold it!

57:43.270 --> 57:44.686
I've told you many times!

57:45.480 --> 57:47.011
I only wanted to steal.

57:47.105 --> 57:48.638
That, or you were hired...

57:49.063 --> 57:50.495
to destroy the ceramics.

57:51.022 --> 57:52.397
To what end, huh, sir?

57:53.354 --> 57:55.572
All I stole are in the kitchen.
Under the firewood!

57:56.188 --> 57:57.360
Just retrieve them!

58:08.230 --> 58:10.230
I do know stealing is wrong.

58:12.566 --> 58:13.980
But if I don't...

58:15.313 --> 58:16.610
I'll starve.

58:21.211 --> 58:22.216
Back then...

58:25.855 --> 58:27.563
Chief Liem had framed me.

58:30.772 --> 58:31.783
I was whipped.

58:32.647 --> 58:33.416
Cursed at.

58:34.355 --> 58:36.100
Shamed, by the whole District.

58:44.772 --> 58:46.563
Since I was marked as a thief,

58:47.640 --> 58:49.699
no one would ever hire me.

58:52.315 --> 58:53.666
Sir, find it in your heart...

58:54.563 --> 58:56.566
Please spare me this time!

58:59.715 --> 59:00.882
It's Nga's jewel box.

59:12.230 --> 59:14.602
If Dong was hired
to ruin the ceramics,

59:15.188 --> 59:16.938
why are they still intact here?

59:19.105 --> 59:21.063
I don't think he's linked to Nga's case.

59:23.420 --> 59:24.147
Mister Dong?

59:24.647 --> 59:27.688
You've committed thievery.
Punishment will be severe.

59:28.147 --> 59:30.194
- I shall speak with Chief Liem...
- Heavens!

59:30.291 --> 59:31.587
Please don't hand me to him!

59:32.397 --> 59:34.329
- He despised me!
- Let me finish...

59:34.563 --> 59:36.422
He'll find cause to chop my hands!

59:37.996 --> 59:39.039
Please don't, sir!

59:39.563 --> 59:41.296
I know nothing about Miss Nga!

59:41.438 --> 59:42.480
If you must arrest...

59:43.813 --> 59:45.151
then arrest Lady Vuong!

59:51.714 --> 59:53.714
Why must we arrest the Chief's wife?

59:54.235 --> 59:56.006
When Miss Nga
spotted me that night...

59:58.281 --> 59:59.916
I ran outside...

01:00:00.794 --> 01:00:03.143
and I saw Lady Vuong,
panicked and all,

01:00:03.771 --> 01:00:05.223
leaving Sir Vinh's place.

01:00:08.522 --> 01:00:09.518
Sir Vinh?

01:00:12.212 --> 01:00:12.837
Lady Vuong?

01:00:15.036 --> 01:00:17.370
A late meeting... It's an affair.

01:00:18.188 --> 01:00:20.096
I think Miss Nga knows.

01:00:22.730 --> 01:00:24.969
So if she's killed,
it stays a secret.

01:00:27.693 --> 01:00:28.976
Should this be known...

01:00:29.647 --> 01:00:31.489
you and Lady Vuong...

01:00:31.943 --> 01:00:33.589
will face the Chief's wrath!

01:00:42.588 --> 01:00:45.004
Your affair with the Chief's wife?

01:00:45.147 --> 01:00:46.185
I do not care.

01:00:47.713 --> 01:00:49.153
But it involves Nga.

01:00:50.938 --> 01:00:52.105
If you won't explain...

01:00:52.897 --> 01:00:54.263
then I will make you!

01:00:57.772 --> 01:00:59.100
It isn't what you think.

01:01:13.105 --> 01:01:14.506
My daughter Tuyet...

01:01:15.063 --> 01:01:18.299
is arranged to marry Thac,
the Ho Dac's house's son.

01:01:25.841 --> 01:01:28.136
Heavenly match. Bless you.

01:01:28.647 --> 01:01:30.191
But there's a wrinkle.

01:01:30.272 --> 01:01:32.570
Your Nga is ruining it all.

01:01:32.688 --> 01:01:34.510
Thac would rather leave.

01:01:34.897 --> 01:01:36.337
He still chooses Nga.

01:01:39.147 --> 01:01:40.147
I get it.

01:01:42.313 --> 01:01:44.480
You'd like me to separate them, yes?

01:01:44.855 --> 01:01:46.597
I only seek a neat resolution.

01:01:49.230 --> 01:01:50.097
True!

01:01:51.861 --> 01:01:53.046
It is as before.

01:01:53.230 --> 01:01:56.063
Always the neatest
and quickest with you, yes?

01:01:56.230 --> 01:01:57.897
Had I not married the Chief,

01:01:58.147 --> 01:02:01.063
you'd never be a fabric merchant.

01:02:01.313 --> 01:02:03.355
Have I ever undermined you?

01:02:05.772 --> 01:02:07.308
You're drowning in debt.

01:02:09.730 --> 01:02:11.938
This sum here should cover it.

01:02:22.147 --> 01:02:23.147
And so...

01:02:23.926 --> 01:02:25.343
Thac speaks only truth.

01:02:26.522 --> 01:02:28.605
For Nga, he broke the arrangement.

01:02:30.188 --> 01:02:31.846
Why not tell us sooner?

01:02:33.480 --> 01:02:36.315
Or did you need Nga to die first?

01:02:38.063 --> 01:02:40.438
But she has always loved you...

01:02:57.063 --> 01:03:00.458
The deal between the Lady
and Sir Vinh made it clear...

01:03:01.272 --> 01:03:02.251
that you...

01:03:02.647 --> 01:03:03.397
Miss Tuyet!

01:03:03.855 --> 01:03:05.694
You've lied about your marriage...

01:03:05.772 --> 01:03:07.480
to make Thac the prime suspect.

01:03:07.936 --> 01:03:09.436
Even Nga's unborn baby...

01:03:09.561 --> 01:03:12.485
is also your fabrication... Correct?

01:03:14.644 --> 01:03:16.066
It's clear as day, then!

01:03:16.686 --> 01:03:18.846
This union primes Nga's vanishing!

01:03:20.311 --> 01:03:22.644
You came to the fabric stall
to frighten Nga.

01:03:22.811 --> 01:03:26.144
The wrong order...
was simply a ruse.

01:03:31.977 --> 01:03:33.887
You told me then "red."

01:03:34.811 --> 01:03:36.875
How could I know
you wanted "betel red"?

01:03:37.186 --> 01:03:39.035
Forgetting specifics,
that was on you.

01:03:39.519 --> 01:03:41.863
Don't you dare snatch what is mine!

01:03:42.811 --> 01:03:43.811
Cunning slut.

01:03:45.686 --> 01:03:47.051
Please don't insult me!

01:03:47.299 --> 01:03:48.386
Men are aplenty here!

01:03:50.753 --> 01:03:52.683
Why target the one meant for me?!

01:03:59.975 --> 01:04:02.297
The two of you then
planned to meet that evening...

01:04:03.686 --> 01:04:05.477
at a place few dare to cross.

01:04:06.703 --> 01:04:07.832
Vu Thien Falls.

01:04:10.686 --> 01:04:12.617
A clue on Nga's slipper....

01:04:13.178 --> 01:04:14.247
has led me there.

01:04:18.394 --> 01:04:22.102
You and Nga talked,
argued and then fought.

01:04:24.227 --> 01:04:25.780
I found a lot of blood at the falls.

01:04:26.186 --> 01:04:27.313
It has to be Nga's.

01:04:27.769 --> 01:04:29.561
- It could also be...
- Don't cut in!

01:04:32.269 --> 01:04:33.051
Miss Tuyet...

01:04:33.436 --> 01:04:35.251
I have enough proof to state...

01:04:35.561 --> 01:04:36.875
that you hurt Nga at the falls.

01:04:37.652 --> 01:04:39.166
I...

01:04:39.686 --> 01:04:40.519
The falls...

01:04:41.619 --> 01:04:42.702
I... I don't...

01:04:42.791 --> 01:04:43.962
"Don't" what?!

01:04:44.727 --> 01:04:47.352
That evening, a person saw you
going to the falls!

01:04:47.961 --> 01:04:50.669
Your hands are full of Nga's blood!
Why bother lying?!

01:05:18.863 --> 01:05:21.560
It is all her fault! Her fault!

01:05:26.916 --> 01:05:30.000
I truly don't mean
to ruin your marriage.

01:05:33.446 --> 01:05:35.154
I know my place well...

01:05:38.795 --> 01:05:40.662
Thac only requests
I be his second.

01:05:40.991 --> 01:05:42.477
But Thac is mine.

01:05:42.995 --> 01:05:44.312
I forbid your presence!

01:05:45.347 --> 01:05:48.196
Saving your marriage...
I think there's still a way.

01:05:48.663 --> 01:05:50.162
To your fucking mother,
your way!

01:05:50.543 --> 01:05:53.112
I needn't bond with your unruly class.

01:05:53.336 --> 01:05:57.369
Best back off, or else I'll get
father to ruin your life.

01:06:06.121 --> 01:06:07.287
You stop right there!

01:06:07.536 --> 01:06:08.519
Wild whore!

01:06:08.846 --> 01:06:10.429
Like mother, like daughter!

01:06:13.802 --> 01:06:14.968
Am I not right?

01:06:19.153 --> 01:06:20.695
How sad for your father.

01:06:20.811 --> 01:06:22.061
Parent to a parasite!

01:06:29.811 --> 01:06:30.769
Enough!

01:06:34.126 --> 01:06:34.936
Tuyet!

01:06:38.544 --> 01:06:39.811
You all right, Tuyet?

01:06:40.277 --> 01:06:41.020
Tuyet?

01:06:53.811 --> 01:06:55.019
I did not mean to...

01:06:55.956 --> 01:06:57.463
I didn't mean to, truly.

01:06:57.650 --> 01:07:00.316
And right after?
You disposed of Nga's body?

01:07:00.897 --> 01:07:01.726
No!

01:07:03.124 --> 01:07:04.457
There was so much blood.

01:07:04.649 --> 01:07:06.649
I was scared. So I ran.

01:07:06.955 --> 01:07:07.678
Tuyet!

01:07:08.503 --> 01:07:10.664
At the falls, there's just blood.
There's no Nga.

01:07:11.404 --> 01:07:12.769
What else can I say?!

01:07:12.864 --> 01:07:14.247
- That's the truth...
- Truth?

01:07:14.555 --> 01:07:17.049
After all of your lies,
how can I believe you?

01:07:17.993 --> 01:07:20.618
I swear. This time, I'm honest.

01:07:20.711 --> 01:07:22.247
Your swear means squat to me!

01:07:22.496 --> 01:07:23.832
What did you do to Nga?!

01:07:23.898 --> 01:07:25.288
- Where is she?!
- Miss Moon!

01:07:25.352 --> 01:07:26.227
Miss Moon!

01:07:30.221 --> 01:07:31.277
Be calm!

01:07:31.789 --> 01:07:32.456
Calm down.

01:07:32.541 --> 01:07:35.687
My daughter has confessed.
Where's her need to lie?

01:07:38.327 --> 01:07:39.394
I know...

01:07:40.616 --> 01:07:41.872
There's water there...

01:07:42.894 --> 01:07:44.325
It has taken Nga...

01:07:46.007 --> 01:07:47.507
The Drowning Ghost.

01:07:50.686 --> 01:07:52.436
Let go! Let me go!

01:07:54.213 --> 01:07:55.963
- Daughter!
- Let go!

01:07:56.227 --> 01:07:58.178
Tuyet will be jailed for assault.

01:07:58.894 --> 01:08:01.364
If you resist, you're defying the Judge.

01:08:01.444 --> 01:08:02.979
My daughter's no murderer!

01:08:03.574 --> 01:08:04.756
Mother, save me!

01:08:04.831 --> 01:08:06.706
Why? Why must you kill Nga?

01:08:06.811 --> 01:08:09.019
Where did she offend?
What wrong did she do?

01:08:09.081 --> 01:08:11.010
If you must kill, kill me! Why Nga?!

01:08:11.237 --> 01:08:14.070
It was an accident!
There was no murder!

01:08:14.171 --> 01:08:16.425
You shut up! You are all devious!

01:08:16.811 --> 01:08:18.780
The Chief's house is full of evildoers!

01:08:19.186 --> 01:08:20.852
- Thac!
- Watch your tongue!

01:08:21.536 --> 01:08:23.545
Accusing the Emperor's men
is a crime!

01:08:23.644 --> 01:08:25.288
When did I accuse? Huh?!

01:08:25.389 --> 01:08:27.642
You are a tyrant! But I'm not afraid!

01:08:27.751 --> 01:08:29.452
Get him out! Beat him!

01:08:30.343 --> 01:08:31.477
And jail him!

01:08:31.561 --> 01:08:33.306
Chief Liem! Pay Nga her life!

01:08:33.477 --> 01:08:34.394
Chief Liem!

01:08:39.644 --> 01:08:41.941
Thac was blasphemous.
I can't intervene.

01:08:43.711 --> 01:08:44.851
- Tuyet!
- Mother!

01:08:44.958 --> 01:08:45.958
Tuyet!

01:08:49.186 --> 01:08:50.912
Mother!
Ah! Let go!

01:08:58.783 --> 01:08:59.761
Miss Moon?

01:09:04.085 --> 01:09:05.919
"A person" saw Tuyet going to the falls...

01:09:06.602 --> 01:09:07.734
You made that up, correct?

01:09:09.852 --> 01:09:11.136
Well, I...

01:09:11.884 --> 01:09:13.894
I was only rattling her cage.

01:09:15.918 --> 01:09:17.668
Tuyet confessed anyway.

01:09:18.540 --> 01:09:21.373
What if the Judge
asked to see this witness?

01:09:21.769 --> 01:09:22.810
Tuyet will go free!

01:09:23.102 --> 01:09:24.102
Then it's fine!

01:09:25.036 --> 01:09:27.536
I just want Nga found!
I don't care!

01:09:28.644 --> 01:09:32.076
Everything has its rules!
Investigations follow procedures!

01:09:32.311 --> 01:09:34.478
If not... how can
this case be solved?

01:09:35.641 --> 01:09:36.861
In your eyes...

01:09:38.488 --> 01:09:40.218
Nga is only a case.

01:09:42.732 --> 01:09:44.918
But she is my child!

01:09:47.449 --> 01:09:48.658
You're too emotional.

01:09:49.227 --> 01:09:51.695
That's why... I never
wanted you to join me.

01:09:52.523 --> 01:09:54.357
Nga is still in danger!

01:09:55.188 --> 01:09:57.690
As if she can wait
for rules and procedures!

01:11:20.477 --> 01:11:21.389
Miss Moon.

01:11:21.644 --> 01:11:24.061
- Did I disturb you?
- Ah, no.

01:11:24.957 --> 01:11:26.096
Thought you were someone.

01:11:28.102 --> 01:11:29.141
Someone...

01:11:29.519 --> 01:11:31.769
I'm waiting for Dinh.
My deputy.

01:11:31.852 --> 01:11:33.894
He'll bring me texts
from the Judge's.

01:11:36.519 --> 01:11:37.894
Deputy...

01:11:41.177 --> 01:11:42.628
About Nga...

01:11:43.394 --> 01:11:45.065
Only you are helping out...

01:11:45.977 --> 01:11:47.727
and yet I scolded you.

01:11:49.156 --> 01:11:50.531
Old habits die hard!

01:11:51.049 --> 01:11:52.549
When I get angry...

01:11:53.422 --> 01:11:54.422
I explode.

01:11:57.837 --> 01:11:59.378
Do forgive me, yes?

01:12:01.727 --> 01:12:03.561
I brought you some food here.

01:12:03.686 --> 01:12:04.686
Thank you, Miss.

01:12:10.441 --> 01:12:11.816
- I...
- And I...

01:12:17.102 --> 01:12:18.561
You were saying?

01:12:20.223 --> 01:12:21.140
I...

01:12:22.510 --> 01:12:23.710
will get back to work.

01:12:28.352 --> 01:12:29.227
Good night.

01:15:18.047 --> 01:15:19.047
Kien!

01:15:19.687 --> 01:15:21.279
Kien!

01:15:22.769 --> 01:15:24.352
Kien? Kien? It's me.

01:15:24.394 --> 01:15:27.144
It's Dinh. Deputy.
You're fine. Kien?

01:15:27.227 --> 01:15:28.186
You're fine.

01:15:29.311 --> 01:15:30.311
You are fine...

01:15:31.187 --> 01:15:32.187
Kien?

01:15:33.392 --> 01:15:35.017
Slow down, chief... Slow down.

01:15:35.307 --> 01:15:36.432
All is well.

01:15:36.892 --> 01:15:39.059
Kien, it's fine. All is well.

01:15:43.436 --> 01:15:44.977
What's wrong, chief?

01:15:47.602 --> 01:15:49.269
I saw the Drowning Ghost.

01:15:49.925 --> 01:15:52.592
It wanted to kill me,
right in this room!

01:15:57.519 --> 01:15:59.460
Your sword isn't blessed,
why pull it out?

01:16:02.894 --> 01:16:04.070
Lily-livered!

01:16:12.061 --> 01:16:13.614
Glad you arrived on time.

01:16:13.985 --> 01:16:15.569
What does the Ghost look like?

01:16:22.936 --> 01:16:24.144
Prettier than you.

01:16:29.352 --> 01:16:30.144
So then...

01:16:30.860 --> 01:16:32.193
Do you have what I ask for?

01:16:32.466 --> 01:16:33.277
I do!

01:16:38.686 --> 01:16:40.811
The criminal cases in this District.

01:16:41.061 --> 01:16:44.519
All had decapitations. Or missing heads.

01:16:46.561 --> 01:16:47.602
That many, huh?

01:16:47.894 --> 01:16:51.436
I've read through them all!
All are distinct...

01:16:51.519 --> 01:16:52.311
Save for one.

01:17:01.394 --> 01:17:04.769
Thirty years ago,
a family of 14 were beheaded.

01:17:05.019 --> 01:17:07.769
They were traitors,
charged with anarchy.

01:17:08.227 --> 01:17:09.644
The text was clear.

01:17:09.727 --> 01:17:12.561
Preying on the famine
and frustrations then,

01:17:12.686 --> 01:17:15.644
this family convinced locals
to take up arms.

01:17:15.852 --> 01:17:19.811
Luckily, there were informers.
So they were caught.

01:17:23.605 --> 01:17:25.811
Research these informers for me.

01:17:25.894 --> 01:17:26.518
Yes, sir!

01:17:31.686 --> 01:17:34.803
The evil roaming here is
one most terrifying!

01:17:35.394 --> 01:17:37.311
The root of the Ghost's anger...

01:17:37.936 --> 01:17:41.311
Does it relate to the family
beheaded 30 years ago?

01:17:41.394 --> 01:17:42.727
That tale is old.

01:17:43.894 --> 01:17:45.186
Details are lost.

01:17:46.144 --> 01:17:48.480
Only the dead know the answers.

01:17:54.269 --> 01:17:55.061
Sir Kien?

01:17:56.019 --> 01:17:57.282
What you should do...

01:17:57.352 --> 01:17:59.686
is to leave this District,
as soon as you can!

01:18:06.227 --> 01:18:07.727
This is a mortregal candle.

01:18:09.977 --> 01:18:11.811
Its flame will flicker...

01:18:11.936 --> 01:18:12.935
when evil's nearby.

01:18:14.161 --> 01:18:16.994
Right when you entered,
the flame went out.

01:18:18.477 --> 01:18:21.644
Those in less danger than you,
they would have fled.

01:18:23.434 --> 01:18:25.017
My case is still open...

01:18:25.574 --> 01:18:27.824
For a case, you'd forsake your life.

01:18:28.602 --> 01:18:29.769
Is it worth it?

01:18:32.644 --> 01:18:34.311
I can still save Nga.

01:18:34.937 --> 01:18:36.562
A life for a life.

01:18:36.769 --> 01:18:37.770
It's worthwhile.

01:18:38.799 --> 01:18:40.132
You're not only bold...

01:18:40.736 --> 01:18:41.944
but also just.

01:18:43.936 --> 01:18:45.686
I pray you safety...

01:18:46.072 --> 01:18:47.358
so you can aid others.

01:18:50.519 --> 01:18:52.769
Things have gone beyond saving...

01:18:53.519 --> 01:18:55.394
Count me out of them.

01:18:56.519 --> 01:18:57.686
But I beg you, dear...

01:18:58.311 --> 01:19:00.394
She, too, is your child!

01:19:01.061 --> 01:19:02.611
Save her, please.

01:19:02.727 --> 01:19:04.404
Then who will save us?!

01:19:05.554 --> 01:19:07.846
If that detective
uncovers anything else...

01:19:08.352 --> 01:19:10.644
I'll tell him that
you forced me to lie!

01:19:10.727 --> 01:19:12.769
If you're falling, fall alone.

01:19:12.962 --> 01:19:14.505
Do not take me with you!

01:19:14.561 --> 01:19:17.269
My dear, please. I beg!

01:19:32.227 --> 01:19:33.916
I went out to buy some herbs...

01:19:34.811 --> 01:19:36.389
He blocked my way again.

01:19:37.055 --> 01:19:38.096
Speak quickly.

01:19:39.020 --> 01:19:41.062
He still has Nga with him.

01:19:41.894 --> 01:19:42.783
What now?

01:19:43.727 --> 01:19:45.019
How is she still alive?!

01:19:45.977 --> 01:19:47.852
I've paid him in full, haven't I?

01:19:48.960 --> 01:19:51.229
Miss Tuyet's arrest... He knows it, too.

01:19:51.561 --> 01:19:52.569
And so?

01:19:54.019 --> 01:19:55.007
He said...

01:19:55.727 --> 01:19:58.519
He knows how... to clear
Miss Tuyet's murder charge.

01:20:00.102 --> 01:20:01.403
He'll chop Nga's head...

01:20:01.809 --> 01:20:03.371
then toss her body into the lake.

01:20:05.727 --> 01:20:07.302
He'll pretend to be the Ghost...

01:20:09.595 --> 01:20:10.511
What's his price?

01:20:12.061 --> 01:20:13.936
Well... 100 more coins.

01:20:34.977 --> 01:20:37.477
When you're done,
the Lady will pay the rest.

01:21:20.180 --> 01:21:21.389
Anyone on your tail?

01:21:29.330 --> 01:21:30.413
Great work, my sweet.

01:22:07.282 --> 01:22:11.369
[One week ago]

01:22:11.477 --> 01:22:13.019
Men are aplenty here!

01:22:14.182 --> 01:22:17.224
Why target the one meant for me?!

01:22:18.477 --> 01:22:19.965
Hour of the Monkey...

01:22:20.855 --> 01:22:23.127
see me at Vu Thien Falls.

01:22:34.811 --> 01:22:37.311
My work's done, Miss!
Where you off to? I'll follow.

01:22:37.436 --> 01:22:38.519
I'll manage.

01:22:38.936 --> 01:22:40.894
- But Lady said...
- You're talking back?

01:22:55.061 --> 01:22:56.477
Are you all right, Tuyet?

01:22:56.623 --> 01:22:57.288
Tuyet?

01:23:31.717 --> 01:23:33.429
You sure Nga is still alive?

01:23:34.607 --> 01:23:35.889
I see she's still breathing!

01:23:36.967 --> 01:23:38.275
I'll fetch the healer.

01:23:38.355 --> 01:23:39.147
Wait.

01:24:10.227 --> 01:24:11.936
Lucky her skull isn't broken...

01:24:16.901 --> 01:24:18.128
What are you thinking?

01:24:18.811 --> 01:24:20.177
Blackmailing the Chief, what else?

01:24:20.836 --> 01:24:21.804
Heavens, no!

01:24:22.568 --> 01:24:23.744
You can't do that!

01:24:33.636 --> 01:24:34.511
Why can't I?

01:24:37.019 --> 01:24:38.894
I fear... if things go wrong...

01:24:38.960 --> 01:24:39.752
What's to fear?!

01:24:41.103 --> 01:24:42.447
Look at Chief Liem.

01:24:44.010 --> 01:24:45.561
He fears nothing!

01:24:46.409 --> 01:24:47.992
And he's above us all!

01:24:54.677 --> 01:24:56.678
- It's past this slope, mother...
- Yes.

01:25:03.541 --> 01:25:05.344
Dong? Someone's here.

01:25:12.519 --> 01:25:13.852
Over there, mother. There!

01:25:15.496 --> 01:25:16.622
We're close.

01:25:22.537 --> 01:25:24.662
How can that be?
Where's Nga, mother?

01:25:25.561 --> 01:25:27.087
If you don't know, how can I?

01:25:27.886 --> 01:25:29.352
Are you sure she was here?

01:25:31.631 --> 01:25:32.394
Blood!

01:25:33.096 --> 01:25:34.180
How can she be gone?!

01:25:34.953 --> 01:25:36.503
Mother, what do I do...?

01:25:37.977 --> 01:25:39.061
Sun's almost down...

01:25:39.541 --> 01:25:42.703
Too late to split up and search.
And if we're seen, we're doomed.

01:25:43.193 --> 01:25:44.860
So seal your lips, you hear?

01:25:46.264 --> 01:25:48.230
- Let's ask father...
- Are you mad?!

01:25:48.769 --> 01:25:49.874
We must not!

01:25:50.358 --> 01:25:51.317
Go!

01:25:55.063 --> 01:25:56.111
Dear Lady...?

01:25:56.476 --> 01:25:57.999
Someone saw Miss Tuyet...

01:25:58.098 --> 01:25:59.519
grabbed a rock,

01:26:00.769 --> 01:26:03.852
took a swing, and killed Nga
of Sir Vinh's house.

01:26:06.269 --> 01:26:09.394
Whoever talks like that,
I'll slap their teeth away!

01:26:11.686 --> 01:26:13.436
I went out to fix your slipper...

01:26:14.727 --> 01:26:16.311
there was a masked man...

01:26:16.400 --> 01:26:17.519
He blocked my way...

01:26:18.061 --> 01:26:19.648
and put a knife to my neck.

01:26:19.727 --> 01:26:21.436
Then he told me about Miss Tuyet.

01:26:30.904 --> 01:26:32.824
Who dares accuse us?

01:26:33.602 --> 01:26:35.019
The masked man, dear Lady.

01:26:35.686 --> 01:26:37.144
My query was rhetorical.

01:26:37.477 --> 01:26:39.019
Why must you answer?

01:26:39.644 --> 01:26:41.644
"Rhetorical"... What's that?

01:26:42.686 --> 01:26:43.811
Rhetorical means...

01:26:44.727 --> 01:26:45.561
Idiot!

01:26:46.477 --> 01:26:47.311
Continue!

01:26:48.686 --> 01:26:51.311
A masked man said he has Nga's body.

01:26:51.394 --> 01:26:54.519
You give him 400 coins,
he'll keep quiet...

01:26:55.519 --> 01:26:57.394
and dispose of her body for you!

01:26:59.102 --> 01:27:00.561
Four hundred?!

01:27:00.852 --> 01:27:02.602
Does he think coins grow on trees?!

01:27:03.227 --> 01:27:05.019
How the hell can I trust him?!

01:27:05.977 --> 01:27:08.644
You don't trust him?
You'll know at the lake tomorrow.

01:27:09.102 --> 01:27:10.061
What did you say?

01:27:10.811 --> 01:27:12.436
I didn't say that. Masked man did...

01:27:19.112 --> 01:27:20.278
This is Nga's slipper...

01:27:34.891 --> 01:27:39.720
[Present]

01:27:44.898 --> 01:27:45.918
Dong...?

01:27:51.561 --> 01:27:53.019
Don't kill Nga, please?

01:28:00.727 --> 01:28:03.008
Then how will I take the rest
from Lady Vuong?

01:28:03.242 --> 01:28:05.867
But you're about to take a life.

01:28:05.950 --> 01:28:07.325
We also have plenty money.

01:28:07.959 --> 01:28:09.001
Let's just leave?

01:28:09.202 --> 01:28:10.367
Don't be greedy.

01:28:12.307 --> 01:28:13.820
You lecturing me now?!

01:28:31.077 --> 01:28:32.160
Please, sir...

01:28:32.862 --> 01:28:34.403
Please don't kill me.

01:28:34.894 --> 01:28:35.894
Don't worry.

01:28:36.561 --> 01:28:37.936
One strike, then done.

01:28:38.715 --> 01:28:39.965
No pain at all.

01:28:42.686 --> 01:28:43.894
Miss!

01:28:44.269 --> 01:28:46.769
Save me. Save me, please.

01:28:47.452 --> 01:28:48.327
Miss...

01:28:48.644 --> 01:28:50.411
Time for the Ghost to kill.

01:29:37.519 --> 01:29:38.561
No, Miss Moon!

01:29:39.061 --> 01:29:41.894
Shaman Tinh must do his ritual
before you can get Nga!

01:31:05.197 --> 01:31:07.613
I love Thac truly, father.

01:31:08.852 --> 01:31:11.894
All these years, you've thought little
of my choices...

01:31:13.519 --> 01:31:14.640
So why interfere now?

01:31:18.727 --> 01:31:20.061
Unruly, like your mother!

01:31:21.061 --> 01:31:22.796
Thac's a bad seed,
yet you still want him!

01:31:24.477 --> 01:31:25.561
I am your father!

01:31:26.269 --> 01:31:27.519
What I say, you obey!

01:31:29.311 --> 01:31:30.227
Have you ever...

01:31:30.977 --> 01:31:33.144
loved me as your own?!

01:32:06.727 --> 01:32:07.769
In your eyes...

01:32:08.284 --> 01:32:09.825
Nga is only a case.

01:32:11.261 --> 01:32:13.215
But she is my child!

01:32:15.436 --> 01:32:17.144
Nga is still in danger!

01:32:18.110 --> 01:32:20.402
As if she can wait
for rules and procedures!

01:32:27.436 --> 01:32:30.769
You've thought it through?
The Judge must approve first...

01:32:31.477 --> 01:32:32.477
It's procedure.

01:32:33.144 --> 01:32:34.192
I do not care.

01:32:34.561 --> 01:32:36.727
Please ask for consent of
the folks here.

01:34:20.311 --> 01:34:21.686
I just learned something!

01:34:23.727 --> 01:34:25.311
You look like you're dying.

01:34:25.986 --> 01:34:27.276
Let me brew some tea.

01:34:27.630 --> 01:34:29.576
I'm fine! Hear me out first.

01:34:32.653 --> 01:34:33.985
Nga wasn't killed by the Ghost.

01:34:35.376 --> 01:34:36.330
Huh?

01:34:37.686 --> 01:34:39.727
When I inspected Nga's body
by the lake...

01:34:40.602 --> 01:34:42.067
I found oddities.

01:34:42.394 --> 01:34:43.811
For victims who drowned...

01:34:44.144 --> 01:34:47.519
the skin on their
hands and feet will wrinkle.

01:34:47.563 --> 01:34:49.816
The result of being in water at length.

01:34:50.477 --> 01:34:52.144
Shaman Tinh also concurred...

01:34:52.436 --> 01:34:55.144
the last eight victims
all had wrinkly skin.

01:34:55.452 --> 01:34:58.443
But... Nga's hands and feet are smooth.

01:34:58.977 --> 01:34:59.989
Which means...

01:35:00.311 --> 01:35:03.276
her body was only recently
dumped into the water.

01:35:04.904 --> 01:35:06.488
Those very details...

01:35:06.727 --> 01:35:09.144
prompted me to exhume
some victims' graves.

01:35:09.419 --> 01:35:10.366
And I found out...

01:35:11.186 --> 01:35:14.436
the cuts on their heads
were haphazard.

01:35:14.711 --> 01:35:16.169
As if many slices were made...

01:35:16.682 --> 01:35:17.791
before decapitation.

01:35:23.751 --> 01:35:25.734
The cut on Nga's head is different.

01:35:26.686 --> 01:35:27.811
The blade was sharp.

01:35:28.894 --> 01:35:30.144
One slice, and done.

01:35:39.894 --> 01:35:41.727
But Nga's body
has surfaced, mother!

01:35:42.375 --> 01:35:43.420
Clearly...

01:35:43.693 --> 01:35:44.902
the Ghost did it!

01:35:46.186 --> 01:35:47.496
So why am I still here?

01:35:47.811 --> 01:35:49.811
You still have the assault charge.

01:35:50.727 --> 01:35:52.727
We must wait for the Judge's verdict.

01:35:53.144 --> 01:35:54.436
What do you mean, mother?!

01:35:55.561 --> 01:35:57.583
You said you could acquit me!

01:35:58.311 --> 01:35:59.977
It's been hard for me, child!

01:36:00.424 --> 01:36:02.424
We're in the Judge's hands now.

01:36:02.769 --> 01:36:04.127
And I'm no miracle worker!

01:36:06.269 --> 01:36:07.269
I trusted you.

01:36:08.144 --> 01:36:10.311
Didn't spill a thing about you!

01:36:11.352 --> 01:36:12.608
Yet, you're abandoning me.

01:36:12.977 --> 01:36:14.436
Had you not confessed...

01:36:14.686 --> 01:36:15.894
you'd be fine!

01:36:16.977 --> 01:36:18.561
But the detective had proof!

01:36:19.311 --> 01:36:21.144
A person saw me going to the falls!

01:36:21.686 --> 01:36:23.203
I thought I was done for then!

01:36:23.311 --> 01:36:25.769
But did they ever name that "person"?

01:36:25.977 --> 01:36:27.614
Clearly, that was to bait you.

01:36:28.727 --> 01:36:30.352
The falls are isolated.

01:36:31.227 --> 01:36:33.186
No one could know you'd go there!

01:36:33.977 --> 01:36:35.019
Heavens...

01:36:35.186 --> 01:36:36.061
What?

01:36:38.019 --> 01:36:39.311
One person knew...

01:36:40.269 --> 01:36:42.269
Tuyet has told me everything.

01:36:43.519 --> 01:36:46.311
You knew she was going
to the falls to meet Nga.

01:36:47.854 --> 01:36:50.104
So you followed her, correct?

01:36:50.977 --> 01:36:53.019
There was no masked man.

01:36:54.602 --> 01:36:56.061
There was only you!

01:36:57.227 --> 01:36:59.894
My Lady... it was...

01:37:01.462 --> 01:37:03.537
It was Dong, he told me to do it.

01:37:07.019 --> 01:37:08.651
Dong, the thief, you mean?

01:37:10.672 --> 01:37:13.882
You wretch!
Have I ever mistreated you, huh?!

01:37:14.977 --> 01:37:17.144
I... I beg you, my Lady...

01:37:18.436 --> 01:37:20.644
I can't stand it any longer!

01:37:21.102 --> 01:37:22.477
What the hell is he to you?!

01:37:23.227 --> 01:37:24.727
That you'd risk it for him?!

01:37:37.352 --> 01:37:38.353
Fortunately...

01:37:38.727 --> 01:37:40.394
you haven't ruined everything.

01:37:41.811 --> 01:37:44.144
Folks are still blaming the Ghost!

01:37:47.477 --> 01:37:48.727
To blame the Ghost...

01:37:49.394 --> 01:37:51.352
was a scheme to distract us.

01:37:55.843 --> 01:37:57.931
I'd say... there's still more to come.

01:37:59.104 --> 01:38:00.023
What more is there?

01:38:01.500 --> 01:38:02.404
Miss Moon.

01:38:02.650 --> 01:38:05.065
Nga's slipper, found by the lake.
May I see it?

01:38:06.811 --> 01:38:08.144
What's been done to Nga...

01:38:08.686 --> 01:38:10.061
consider it done.

01:38:12.633 --> 01:38:14.078
Done how, my Lady?

01:38:14.809 --> 01:38:16.452
Dong planned to extort you more!

01:38:18.269 --> 01:38:20.811
But he has nothing else
to pressure me!

01:38:32.269 --> 01:38:33.169
Doesn't fit.

01:38:33.269 --> 01:38:36.061
No wonder... I found "Nga" here peculiar!

01:38:36.264 --> 01:38:38.133
I only thought the water had altered her.

01:38:45.575 --> 01:38:46.950
This body is still fresh.

01:38:47.311 --> 01:38:48.977
No signs of rot or swelling.

01:38:50.394 --> 01:38:51.672
If these feet are normal...

01:38:53.342 --> 01:38:55.050
then why didn't the slipper fit?

01:38:55.818 --> 01:38:56.610
Mister Kien...

01:38:58.519 --> 01:39:00.019
I think this body here...

01:39:05.144 --> 01:39:06.397
it is not Nga's at all.

01:39:08.977 --> 01:39:09.788
What did you say?

01:39:10.050 --> 01:39:11.883
It's a body Dong found...

01:39:12.444 --> 01:39:14.147
He decapitated
a girl who just died.

01:39:17.846 --> 01:39:18.971
And what of Nga then?

01:39:19.770 --> 01:39:20.977
She is still alive.

01:39:21.894 --> 01:39:23.322
If this isn't Nga...

01:39:24.477 --> 01:39:25.810
then where is she now?

01:39:28.811 --> 01:39:30.227
Is she at the Chief's home?

01:39:31.394 --> 01:39:33.644
This was a distraction
to save Tuyet.

01:39:35.894 --> 01:39:36.602
I'm unsure.

01:39:37.348 --> 01:39:38.602
Had they captured Nga...

01:39:39.084 --> 01:39:40.542
she would've been long dead.

01:39:41.602 --> 01:39:43.311
Why bother with a false corpse?

01:39:46.436 --> 01:39:47.894
So who's keeping Nga?

01:39:48.800 --> 01:39:50.425
She's still in the caves.

01:40:01.186 --> 01:40:02.894
Nga and Dong...

01:40:03.602 --> 01:40:04.989
They both must be killed.

01:40:12.352 --> 01:40:13.269
Maid Mui!

01:40:15.186 --> 01:40:16.936
Don't look at me like that!

01:40:18.228 --> 01:40:19.395
You know well...

01:40:21.735 --> 01:40:25.568
If either Nga or Dong
spills to the detective?

01:40:25.644 --> 01:40:27.936
You and I will be in deep trouble.

01:40:32.811 --> 01:40:33.894
I get you.

01:40:35.352 --> 01:40:37.186
What my Lady asks, I'll do it.

01:40:37.977 --> 01:40:39.436
Get me to where Nga is.

01:40:42.389 --> 01:40:44.889
She is... behind a secured door.

01:40:44.977 --> 01:40:46.477
It needs a key...

01:40:46.702 --> 01:40:48.295
that Dong always brings along.

01:40:53.006 --> 01:40:55.006
Then we'll meet him to get the key.

01:40:55.620 --> 01:40:56.495
Dong.

01:40:57.712 --> 01:40:58.662
Heavens...

01:40:59.203 --> 01:41:00.269
So I was right!

01:41:04.644 --> 01:41:05.477
Mister Kien?

01:41:06.562 --> 01:41:08.854
I gifted Nga this when she was young.

01:41:09.333 --> 01:41:10.625
She'd always wear it.

01:41:10.894 --> 01:41:13.171
In bed, in the shower.
I swear it!

01:41:21.656 --> 01:41:22.977
It's Nga's jewel box.

01:41:26.123 --> 01:41:28.242
We found it in Dong's house.

01:41:28.708 --> 01:41:30.452
He is the one holding Nga!

01:41:32.519 --> 01:41:34.206
That's why he has Nga's bangle!

01:41:34.642 --> 01:41:35.813
Marvelous, Miss Moon!

01:41:41.739 --> 01:41:42.622
Maid Mui!

01:41:47.311 --> 01:41:49.172
At least three drops, you hear?

01:41:50.599 --> 01:41:51.605
Yes...

01:42:17.977 --> 01:42:19.004
Calm down.

01:42:20.971 --> 01:42:22.569
It's just the two of us.

01:42:26.727 --> 01:42:28.792
Lady wants to meet you and talk.

01:42:37.596 --> 01:42:39.520
Please sit, I'll fetch some water.

01:42:45.515 --> 01:42:46.765
What has she told you?

01:42:47.702 --> 01:42:48.908
Enough to know...

01:42:49.610 --> 01:42:52.402
that you're sharp.
And can be reasoned with.

01:42:52.686 --> 01:42:53.977
I'm having the upper hand.

01:42:55.652 --> 01:42:57.061
What I say, you listen.

01:42:57.561 --> 01:42:58.769
No need for reasoning.

01:42:58.936 --> 01:43:02.144
If guards barge in,
you sure can run...

01:43:02.304 --> 01:43:04.980
but you'll live
in hiding forever.

01:43:06.644 --> 01:43:08.227
I've risked everything...

01:43:08.994 --> 01:43:10.327
to get what I have.

01:43:11.311 --> 01:43:12.936
When I am cornered...

01:43:13.269 --> 01:43:14.394
I'll be defiant, too.

01:43:14.596 --> 01:43:16.264
No one likes to lose it all.

01:43:16.519 --> 01:43:18.269
And so reasoning seems right.

01:43:38.228 --> 01:43:39.212
What do you want?

01:43:39.447 --> 01:43:40.904
You haven't killed Nga...

01:43:41.144 --> 01:43:43.519
to keep blackmailing me, yes?

01:43:54.602 --> 01:43:57.394
This is double of
what you asked last time.

01:43:57.811 --> 01:44:00.727
Enough for you and Mui
to live in abundance.

01:44:30.686 --> 01:44:32.436
You sold me out, huh?

01:44:33.602 --> 01:44:35.019
Consider your share gone, then.

01:45:02.602 --> 01:45:03.894
Fine that she died.

01:45:05.227 --> 01:45:06.436
Fewer loose ends.

01:45:07.430 --> 01:45:09.139
You should go with her, too.

01:45:10.311 --> 01:45:12.519
I wrote a letter before coming here.

01:45:13.436 --> 01:45:15.061
Should I fail to return,

01:45:15.227 --> 01:45:16.811
it will reach Detective Kien.

01:45:18.007 --> 01:45:19.132
How smart!

01:45:20.332 --> 01:45:22.124
But he won't arrive in time.

01:45:22.654 --> 01:45:24.363
Your money isn't here, though.

01:45:36.936 --> 01:45:38.311
I want to see...

01:45:39.394 --> 01:45:41.144
Nga die by your hand.

01:46:01.852 --> 01:46:02.952
Satisfied?

01:46:28.902 --> 01:46:30.277
- Nga...
- Miss Moon!

01:46:32.727 --> 01:46:33.700
Calm down.

01:46:33.936 --> 01:46:35.186
We wait for a window.

01:46:35.436 --> 01:46:37.477
When Nga's safe,
only then we strike!

01:46:38.610 --> 01:46:40.527
Why the wait? Just do it.

01:46:41.023 --> 01:46:42.352
Pay me, then I'll do it.

01:46:44.683 --> 01:46:46.582
I've hidden the money near your home.

01:47:13.810 --> 01:47:14.810
Get out front.

01:47:15.622 --> 01:47:17.413
I hate being shadowed.

01:47:39.936 --> 01:47:40.977
Get the money.

01:47:41.144 --> 01:47:42.352
Don't just stand there.

01:47:42.519 --> 01:47:45.102
- You turned on me once. Why would...
- It's simple.

01:47:45.644 --> 01:47:46.727
You pay me...

01:47:46.885 --> 01:47:48.010
I kill her.

01:47:48.418 --> 01:47:49.460
Keep on stalling...

01:47:50.477 --> 01:47:51.727
and I'll kill you, too!

01:48:07.311 --> 01:48:07.977
Mister Kien...

01:48:08.644 --> 01:48:09.477
I'm fine.

01:48:11.144 --> 01:48:12.394
Give me the money. Quick!

01:48:42.200 --> 01:48:43.124
It seems...

01:48:43.186 --> 01:48:44.852
this crime has two criminals.

01:48:45.689 --> 01:48:46.777
To really go free...

01:48:47.644 --> 01:48:48.936
we must kill them all.

01:48:49.027 --> 01:48:49.860
Surrender!

01:48:51.876 --> 01:48:53.042
You go after Nga.

01:48:54.077 --> 01:48:55.160
I'll deal with him.

01:49:03.770 --> 01:49:05.520
Last time, I gave you an out.

01:49:06.753 --> 01:49:08.711
But then you dug yourself deeper.

01:49:18.686 --> 01:49:19.602
So now...

01:49:21.102 --> 01:49:22.352
I can bury your bones!

01:49:36.602 --> 01:49:37.368
Nga!

01:49:38.354 --> 01:49:39.311
Hold it!

01:49:40.269 --> 01:49:41.394
Stop running, Nga!

01:49:47.064 --> 01:49:49.939
It's Auntie Moon! It's me. It's auntie!

01:50:01.394 --> 01:50:02.144
Nga!

01:50:07.227 --> 01:50:09.644
Found you, my child. Oh, Nga!

01:50:19.011 --> 01:50:21.011
I won't ever leave you again.

01:50:22.686 --> 01:50:23.977
Promise!

01:50:28.825 --> 01:50:31.325
It's dangerous here. Let's move.

01:50:41.686 --> 01:50:42.894
Surprised, I see?

01:50:42.977 --> 01:50:44.436
None at all, really.

01:50:45.139 --> 01:50:48.019
Those were the moves
of the Mountain Bandits.

01:50:48.144 --> 01:50:50.019
A detective and a scholar.

01:50:50.519 --> 01:50:51.436
You know everything...

01:51:08.474 --> 01:51:09.061
Auntie Moon!

01:51:11.644 --> 01:51:12.477
Lady Vuong!

01:51:13.602 --> 01:51:14.477
You must stop this!

01:51:15.394 --> 01:51:16.477
Must you really do this?!

01:51:16.686 --> 01:51:17.894
What the fuck do you know?!

01:51:18.227 --> 01:51:19.227
But I do!

01:51:20.061 --> 01:51:21.352
You're doing this for your child!

01:51:21.727 --> 01:51:24.144
Thanks to that brat, I'm now in tatters!

01:51:24.352 --> 01:51:26.311
For my rank and my right,

01:51:26.727 --> 01:51:27.811
you all must die!

01:51:31.352 --> 01:51:32.686
Nga! Run, child!

01:51:33.477 --> 01:51:34.686
Run and find help!

01:51:36.811 --> 01:51:38.936
You freaking hag... I can take you!

01:53:46.061 --> 01:53:47.561
Saved myself time...

01:53:48.019 --> 01:53:49.352
hunting you down!

01:54:13.561 --> 01:54:16.144
This witch tries anything,
hit her like so for me!

01:54:59.747 --> 01:55:00.519
Mister Kien!

01:55:02.080 --> 01:55:02.811
Nga...?

01:55:03.644 --> 01:55:04.577
She's all well.

01:55:09.887 --> 01:55:10.727
Mister Kien!

01:55:12.311 --> 01:55:13.602
Please don't die! Mister Kien?

01:55:13.811 --> 01:55:14.477
Mister Kien!

01:55:15.186 --> 01:55:16.144
Kien!

01:55:20.936 --> 01:55:22.311
Don't wish death upon me...

01:55:24.602 --> 01:55:25.727
I just need a break.

01:55:28.477 --> 01:55:29.477
Ah... don't.

01:56:03.049 --> 01:56:03.816
Nga!

01:57:17.852 --> 01:57:20.644
This morning, guards led
Lady Vuong and Tuyet away...

01:57:21.852 --> 01:57:23.269
Seeing them like that...

01:57:23.519 --> 01:57:24.936
I feel quite sorry for them.

01:57:25.769 --> 01:57:27.311
With crime, come punishment.

01:57:27.769 --> 01:57:29.203
It's the way things go.

01:57:35.561 --> 01:57:39.186
Some treats from Nga and I.
Your journey's long, so they'll help.

01:57:39.568 --> 01:57:41.311
I know not how to thank you, truly.

01:57:41.936 --> 01:57:43.227
Finding Nga was my duty.

01:57:44.644 --> 01:57:47.602
You didn't just find her.
You also saved her.

01:57:48.436 --> 01:57:49.686
This great debt...

01:57:50.477 --> 01:57:52.102
it will take lifetimes to pay.

01:57:54.852 --> 01:57:56.102
These treats will do.

01:57:56.638 --> 01:57:57.523
My thanks, Miss Moon.

01:58:02.727 --> 01:58:04.186
Here's your towel, too.

01:58:06.531 --> 01:58:07.352
Keep it, Miss Moon.

01:58:08.852 --> 01:58:12.199
I've washed and washed it.
All my scent is gone, so stop wishing!

01:58:14.737 --> 01:58:15.706
I mean, stop worrying.

01:58:16.477 --> 01:58:17.602
No wishing from me.

01:58:18.436 --> 01:58:20.602
You keep it.
Consider it a memento.

01:58:22.144 --> 01:58:24.727
If the winds of fate
steer you back here...

01:58:25.144 --> 01:58:28.352
then... I'm sure you know...
where to...

01:58:28.602 --> 01:58:31.477
find food that's fresh... and also...

01:58:31.758 --> 01:58:32.758
warm.

01:58:34.943 --> 01:58:36.167
I will soon return.

01:58:36.475 --> 01:58:38.486
I knew it! You love m...

01:58:41.012 --> 01:58:43.095
Love my food, don't you?

01:58:46.061 --> 01:58:47.021
I mean...

01:58:47.352 --> 01:58:49.102
the Drowning Ghost
is still a mystery.

01:58:49.644 --> 01:58:50.977
Can't break from here yet.

01:58:52.126 --> 01:58:55.098
Until then, rely on Shaman Tinh's
amulet and incense.

01:58:55.354 --> 01:58:58.354
I'll be honest with you...
I can't use his incense.

01:58:58.727 --> 01:58:59.804
My immunity's sensitive.

01:59:00.477 --> 01:59:02.394
Its smoke clogs my airways.

01:59:02.852 --> 01:59:05.269
But, luckily,
the Ghost hasn't haunted me!

01:59:12.727 --> 01:59:14.138
You don't use his incense...

01:59:16.352 --> 01:59:17.561
And you don't see the Ghost?

01:59:24.644 --> 01:59:26.394
While resting at the healer's here...

01:59:27.394 --> 01:59:28.602
no incense was used.

01:59:29.713 --> 01:59:30.797
And during that time...

01:59:32.311 --> 01:59:33.686
I didn't see the Ghost.

01:59:39.039 --> 01:59:40.019
Miss Moon!

01:59:40.561 --> 01:59:42.099
Please write to the Judge.

01:59:42.211 --> 01:59:43.305
I need to see a Physician.

01:59:47.311 --> 01:59:51.061
This incense is made from
the manqida plant. A toxin.

01:59:51.519 --> 01:59:55.686
It causes hallucinations,
amplifies fears.

01:59:56.311 --> 01:59:59.852
Gentle tempers will see things.

02:00:00.269 --> 02:00:01.644
Hardened ones will go mad.

02:00:02.394 --> 02:00:05.936
A bleeding nose means
you're resisting the toxin.

02:00:48.227 --> 02:00:50.977
Judge has placed the guards
where you asked them.

02:00:52.144 --> 02:00:55.144
I've looked through past cases
and found something.

02:00:55.894 --> 02:00:57.519
About the family of traitors.

02:00:58.852 --> 02:01:00.602
There were a total of 15 members.

02:01:01.394 --> 02:01:03.811
But only 14 were caught and beheaded.

02:01:04.436 --> 02:01:07.145
We've been framed!
We don't conspire to rebel!

02:01:07.852 --> 02:01:10.644
The sole survivor...
was a 10-year-old boy.

02:01:13.501 --> 02:01:15.380
Kill them!

02:01:30.852 --> 02:01:34.227
After the execution, he disappeared.

02:01:34.394 --> 02:01:35.519
If my guess is true...

02:01:35.644 --> 02:01:37.936
this boy is now
Shaman Tinh's age.

02:01:47.602 --> 02:01:50.061
Not long after
he came to this District...

02:01:51.144 --> 02:01:52.894
the Drowning Ghost struck.

02:01:54.311 --> 02:01:55.936
An odd coincidence!

02:01:57.519 --> 02:02:00.714
His incense is the spell
that kept folks weary.

02:02:01.561 --> 02:02:04.269
A scheme in a scheme.
He kills, he scares.

02:02:04.852 --> 02:02:08.102
He's both the Ghost...
and the shaman.

02:02:48.561 --> 02:02:51.394
While you were poisoned,
and most confused,

02:02:52.061 --> 02:02:54.311
what did you see,
Detective Kien?

02:02:55.186 --> 02:02:56.186
As for me?

02:02:56.602 --> 02:02:58.311
For the past 30 years...

02:02:58.599 --> 02:03:01.640
I'd see my entire family.

02:03:03.644 --> 02:03:05.811
None of them were traitors.

02:03:06.686 --> 02:03:09.686
Chief Liem and his men
had framed my family.

02:03:10.061 --> 02:03:13.186
It all came back
to their hunger for power.

02:03:17.061 --> 02:03:20.186
Those who remain... their time shall come.

02:03:20.727 --> 02:03:22.477
As long as I draw breath...

02:03:22.769 --> 02:03:27.115
the Ghost... will haunt them still.

02:03:27.186 --> 02:03:28.144
Drowning Ghost!

02:03:28.602 --> 02:03:29.852
It is killing again!

02:03:55.227 --> 02:03:56.936
Grudges conjure ghosts...

02:03:57.519 --> 02:03:58.269
Evil...

02:03:58.977 --> 02:04:00.477
can't be solved with evil.

02:04:01.269 --> 02:04:03.019
This grim cycle must end!

02:04:27.936 --> 02:04:30.311
He fled, and with a winter coat.

02:04:30.894 --> 02:04:32.477
He's off to the cold regions.

02:04:32.852 --> 02:04:33.852
We're riding north!

02:07:49.106 --> 02:07:53.502
[Inspired by the novel "Ho Oan Han"
by Hong Thai]
